{"title":"Career Roadmap · Energy Manager","role":"Energy Manager","summary":"An Energy Manager plans, monitors and improves how energy is generated, purchased, distributed and consumed within an organization or industrial facility.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Power Engineering"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Energy Manager plans, monitors and improves how energy is generated, purchased, distributed and consumed within an organization or industrial facility."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines power engineering, electrical systems, energy auditing, energy efficiency, renewable energy, utilities, automation, data analytics and sustainability."},{"type":"p","text":"An Energy Manager may work across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Industrial plants"},{"text":"Commercial buildings"},{"text":"Manufacturing facilities"},{"text":"Data centers"},{"text":"Utilities"},{"text":"Renewable-energy projects"},{"text":"Large campuses"},{"text":"Infrastructure organizations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The modern role is moving from simply reducing electricity bills toward data-driven energy optimization, electrification, renewable integration, energy storage, demand management and carbon reduction."},{"type":"h","text":"Core Career Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Power Systems","Energy Efficiency","Electrical Utilities","Energy Auditing","Renewable Energy","Automation","Data Analytics","Sustainability"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech / B.E. Power Engineering","Electrical & Power Engineering","Power Generation & Distribution","Energy Consumption & Utilities","Energy Auditing & Measurement","Efficiency & Loss Analysis","Motors / HVAC / Boilers /"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Compressors / Transformers / Loads","Renewable Energy + Storage","Automation + Energy Monitoring","Data 